{"schema_version":1,"status":"complete","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01240-s02","batch":1240,"shard":2,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":40,"shard_end_exclusive":60,"translated_count":20,"entries":[{"entry_index":40,"uid":"zhcn:510bcf7a8e8eca6e07909428","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"就算状态不好……\r\n我也不会放弃，只要专注勇往直前。\r\n这才是「女帝」该有的样子……","source_fingerprint":"63af6082a5b103b8c21c79e875f4dfe09cb592f55fe8d2f282729c0314343dbd","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20034"],"target_text":"Dù trạng thái không tốt…\r\ntôi cũng sẽ không bỏ cuộc, chỉ cần tập trung tiến thẳng về phía trước.\r\nĐó mới là dáng vẻ của 「Nữ Đế」…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":41,"uid":"zhcn:c659a40aba74f312d2b87701","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"没能调整到万全的状态……\r\n这就像是场恶梦，\r\n但我不会被恶梦打败的……！","source_fingerprint":"b1bb4728411ce1d884ac7be03a62dc14563272e3d868ba2a5d97f97c60299c83","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20035"],"target_text":"Không thể điều chỉnh tới trạng thái hoàn hảo…\r\nCứ như một cơn ác mộng,\r\nnhưng tôi sẽ không để ác mộng đánh bại…!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":42,"uid":"zhcn:5de7671912f9ef8605df28b7","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔……没想到竟然会是这种状态，\r\n实在情何以堪。\r\n但……我还是要紧咬着胜利不放。","source_fingerprint":"24933477f3b0e55195407872fe483eb2167595bc24e6a1d2686dd1ebc81b39ef","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20036"],"target_text":"Ừm… không ngờ lại rơi vào trạng thái thế này,\r\nthật khó mà chấp nhận.\r\nNhưng… tôi vẫn sẽ bám chặt lấy chiến thắng.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":43,"uid":"zhcn:32a9ee9af28514772b063563","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔……状态差到连眼神都无法集中。\r\n但我还是要保持冷静才行……","source_fingerprint":"6a60b42331c91156b2a78f77a9d0398c701439922d6b649b399d28ce594ada7b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20037"],"target_text":"Ừm… trạng thái tệ đến mức ánh mắt cũng không thể tập trung.\r\nNhưng tôi vẫn phải giữ bình tĩnh…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":44,"uid":"zhcn:0353f5384813ac698a5deb51","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"了解了。","source_fingerprint":"0aa172dae78209df2f14e91329ffda222530cabbd0fff916fc7abb9ccad4ffc9","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20038"],"target_text":"Tôi hiểu rồi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":45,"uid":"zhcn:877e936777d6b633e99a62b4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好吧……","source_fingerprint":"b4897f52c43d9b474d83e48ba7ec90f706f33789d73c0b336301f7717056677f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20039"],"target_text":"Được thôi…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":46,"uid":"zhcn:04e89866745c92fab1e362d1","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好，知道了。","source_fingerprint":"58c6339e12dc8519d5db434cf6c39947f317c74bfed19b8e9d6a8551f629f3a4","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20040"],"target_text":"Được, tôi hiểu rồi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":47,"uid":"zhcn:dad4d5b36f9600fb447fbf08","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"智谋才是武器，是吗？","source_fingerprint":"a36e6f60ac4ea98dbb416f47dc9247a262f118280372e9aeb959c401d9b79fcb","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20041"],"target_text":"Trí mưu mới là vũ khí, phải không?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":48,"uid":"zhcn:69df4de71ddc5cd5fd222b43","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔。","source_fingerprint":"533af1ec55aaabd2fb64979f1b375b53b2aa3d91c5132bfaaf1eceef39f399ef","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20042"],"target_text":"Ừm.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":49,"uid":"zhcn:7bdd3e1992be36c37f2ffe1a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"太难堪了……","source_fingerprint":"000c49426fab534249ce02f305055455f697a8df1ed2723ceef9d5c350c7428e","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20043"],"target_text":"Thật đáng xấu hổ…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":50,"uid":"zhcn:62ff174f7f5e7901f69624f9","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"要上场了。","source_fingerprint":"b7ae06627c688f0d088a0dec073c588f1374c7334300267b4d6feffee9fbeb23","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20046"],"target_text":"Đến lúc ra sân rồi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":51,"uid":"zhcn:3d6a143e15db746c9be93f5e","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"别那么激动。","source_fingerprint":"5c63ed1e46a306a6ccb27b16637e6e1a544e5b7b66f4898e61d7c16403aa08cd","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20047"],"target_text":"Đừng kích động như vậy.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":52,"uid":"zhcn:2a4cc4e48ec1cf566c2ad3ee","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"有劳了……今后也麻烦你了。","source_fingerprint":"36a4516e03249e5b1d4478ce6f975161afc8afa6a256d51a876960a0d2cc8623","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20049"],"target_text":"Vất vả cho cậu rồi… từ nay cũng nhờ cậu.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":53,"uid":"zhcn:5aae51667a42cb1b20acd7d7","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"今后也要继续努力。","source_fingerprint":"ff7968a6e2d5288ca1ff827df7f351fb7c19560c22fdf96c20d000dc303d3224","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20050"],"target_text":"Từ nay cũng phải tiếp tục cố gắng.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":54,"uid":"zhcn:8f066cdc7883ef5f674b05a7","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"开始锻炼吧。","source_fingerprint":"d6dc10fa3aa19f142e943d231e41fd8e0277977dcbe2514d658a4202973cbd9f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","20051"],"target_text":"Bắt đầu tập luyện thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":55,"uid":"zhcn:8e4b49d88c21c70d5efe0beb","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"打起精神迎战吧。","source_fingerprint":"2a0e7ce630ad5f0dd10873407fba8c959835a6b581c2fa7f9932273c5313ec8e","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","2030"],"target_text":"Lên tinh thần và nghênh chiến thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":56,"uid":"zhcn:1c2de09399611fdd4fcea5b3","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我们要一起拿下胜利！","source_fingerprint":"8653cf33894e5c13d166480fd5675fb93d7f7d1712b1cf3efd573bdbfb4af7ba","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","2031"],"target_text":"Chúng ta sẽ cùng nhau giành chiến thắng!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":57,"uid":"zhcn:cd152ee263571968a3baad92","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"今后也要继续努力。","source_fingerprint":"ff7968a6e2d5288ca1ff827df7f351fb7c19560c22fdf96c20d000dc303d3224","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","2032"],"target_text":"Từ nay cũng phải tiếp tục cố gắng.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":58,"uid":"zhcn:088fe13f3d18f8f33776b39d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"走吧！\r\n让后进们看看我的背影……！","source_fingerprint":"cf743c59cba5a14f6293c077fc5fdda6ebeb31b6ebe963b8986c786bba72a2db","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","2033"],"target_text":"Đi thôi!\r\nHãy để các đàn em chỉ còn thấy bóng lưng của tôi…!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":59,"uid":"zhcn:f8c81be0b438edf91cdb33f7","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呵……这怎么行，\r\n我竟然受到会场气氛的影响，\r\n情绪跟着高涨了。","source_fingerprint":"fbc1b8f392f2e70627b8520775aebc9666d7b82e2b8172e1cd5fa51e3c44cbf6","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1018","2034"],"target_text":"Hừ… thế này không được,\r\nkhông ngờ tôi lại bị bầu không khí ở trường đua cuốn theo,\r\nđến mức tinh thần cũng phấn chấn lên.","reviewed":true}]}